      "source": "https://appalachianhistorian.org/lynch-harlan-county-the-rise-and-memory-of-kentuckys-largest-company-coal-town/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Squeezed by mountains and a railroad, Lynch developed in a long, narrow form along the valley floor of Looney Creek.",
